    "correct": 4,
    "solution": "<p><strong>The logic followed here is:&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Sum of the numbers either column wise or row wise is 75.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-109.png\" style=\"width: 177px; height: 118px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>So,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-110.png\" style=\"width: 49px; height: 114px;\" />&rarr; 24 + ? + 28 = 75&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; ? = 75 - 52&nbsp;&rarr; ? = 23</span></p>\n\n<p>And,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-111.png\" style=\"width: 49px; height: 114px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 29 + ? + 21 = 75&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; ? = 75 - 50&nbsp;&rarr; ? = 25</span></p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-112.png\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 111px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 22 + ? + 26 = 75&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; ? = 75 - 48&nbsp;&rarr; ? = 27</span></p>\n\n<p>Thus,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-113.png\" style=\"width: 131px; height: 33px;\" />&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;23, 25, 27</span></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>&quot;Option 4&quot; </strong>is the correct answer.</p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p><strong>यहाँ अनुसरित तर्क इस प्रकार है:</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">या तो स्तंभवार या पंक्तिवार संख्याओं का योग 75 है।</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-109.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 177px; height: 118px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>इसलिए,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-110.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 49px; height: 114px;\" />&rarr; 24 + ? + 28 = 75 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; ? = 75 - 52 &rarr; ? = 23</span></p>\n\n<p>और,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-111.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 49px; height: 114px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 29 + ? + 21 = 75 &rarr; ? = 75 - 50 &rarr; ? = 25</span></p>\n\n<p>इसी प्रकार,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-112.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 50px; height: 111px;\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 22 + ? + 26 = 75 &rarr; ? = 75 - 48 &rarr; ? = 27</span></p>\n\n<p>इस प्रकार, <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/4-4-2025%20IMG-570%20-113.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 131px; height: 33px;\" /> <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr;23, 25, 27</span></p>\n\n<p>अतः, <strong>&quot;विकल्प 4&quot;</strong> सही उत्तर है।</p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
