    "correct": 2,
    "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">The logic followed here is:&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>Column wise: 1st number&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times; 2nd number - 3rd number = 4th number</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Column 1) 4&nbsp;&times; 5 - 6 = 20 - 6 = 14</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Column 2) 5&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times; 4 - 4 = 20 - 4 = 16</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Column 3) 6&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times; 4 - 5 = 24 - 5 = <strong>19</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;19&quot;.</span></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">यहाँ अनुसरित तर्क निम्नानुसार है:</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>स्तंभवार: पहली संख्या </strong><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&times;</span><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> दूसरी संख्या - तीसरी संख्या = चौथी संख्या</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">स्तंभ 1) 4 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> 5 - 6 = 20 - 6 = 14</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">स्तंभ 2) 5 &times; 4 - 4 = 20 - 4 = 16&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">स्तंभ 3) 6 &times; 4 - 5 = 24 - 5 = <strong>19</strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">इसलिए, सही उत्तर <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&quot;19&quot;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">है।&nbsp;</span></p>\n",
