    "question": "<p>Find the missing number in the following figure.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%201.png\" style=\"width: 436px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n",
    "question_hi": "<p>नीचे दिए गए चित्र में अनुपस्थित संख्या ज्ञात कीजिए।</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%201.png\" style=\"width: 436px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n",
    "options": [
      "3",
      "4",
