    "correct": 4,
    "solution": "<p>Logic followed here is,</p>\n\n<p>For,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%202.png\" style=\"width: 114px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(3 + 4 + 5)&nbsp;&times; 3 = 12&nbsp;&times; 3 = 36&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%203.png\" style=\"width: 114px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(1 + 7 + 3)&nbsp;&times; 4 = 11&nbsp;&times; 4 = 44</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>Let the&nbsp;missing number be x.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%204.png\" style=\"width: 114px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(9 + 8 + 5)&nbsp;&times; x = 44</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;22x = 44</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = 44/22 = <strong>2</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 2.&quot;</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>यहाँ अनुसरित&nbsp;तर्क निम्न&nbsp;है:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%202.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 114px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(3 + 4 + 5) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> 3 = 12 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> 3 = 36</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%203.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 114px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(1 + 7 + 3) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> 4 = 11 <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> 4 = 44</p>\n\n<p>इसी प्रकार,</p>\n\n<p>मान लीजिए&nbsp;लुप्त संख्या x है।</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/05/5-5-2025%20IMG-1238%20LK%20-%204.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 114px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>(9 + 8 + 5) <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&times;</span> x = 44</p>\n\n<p>22x = 44</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x = 44/22 = <strong>2</strong></p>\n\n<p>इसलिए, सही उत्तर <strong>&quot;विकल्प 2&quot;</strong> है।</p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
  },
