    "correct": 2,
    "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>Logic:&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">In column-wise</span></p>\n\n<p>(1st number + 2nd number)&nbsp;&times; 3rd number = 4th number.</p>\n\n<p>Ist column:</p>\n\n<p>&rarr; (8 + 7)&nbsp;&times; 6&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 15&nbsp;&times; 6</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 90 = 4th number.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">IInd column:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&rarr; (7 + 6)&nbsp;&times; 6&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 13&nbsp;&times; 6</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 65&nbsp;= 4th number.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>IIIrd column:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong><span style=\"  font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">&rarr; (6&nbsp;+ 5)&nbsp;&times; 4&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>&rarr; 11&nbsp;&times; 4</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>&rarr; 44.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 2&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p>यहाँ प्रयुक्त तर्क है:</p>\n\n<p>तर्क: <span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">स्तंभवार</span></p>\n\n<p>(पहली संख्या + दूसरी संख्या) x तीसरी संख्या = चौथी संख्या।</p>\n\n<p>प्रथम स्तंभ:</p>\n\n<p>→ (8 + 7) x 6 </p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ 15 x 6</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ 90 = चौथी संख्या।</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">द्वितीय स्तंभ:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var(--bs-body-font-family); font-size: var(--bs-body-font-size); font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">→ (7 + 6) x 6 </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ 13 x 6</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">→ 78 = चौथी संख्या।</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>तृतीय स्तंभ:</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong><span style=\"  font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">→ (6 + 5) x 4 </span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>→ 11 x 4</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><strong>→ 44.</strong></p>\n\n<p>इसलिए, सही उत्तर <strong>\"विकल्प 2\"</strong> है।</p>\n",
    "marks": "0.97"
