    "solution": "<p><strong>The logic followed here is:</strong> Row wise pattern is followed here.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-66.png\" style=\"width: 127px; height: 22px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; <u><strong>(1&nbsp;&times; 2)</strong></u> + <u><strong>(4&nbsp;&times; 2)</strong></u> = 10</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; <u><strong>2 + 8</strong></u> = 10</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 10 = 10 (LHS = RHS)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">And,</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-67.png\" style=\"width: 127px; height: 22px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(2&nbsp;&times; 3)</span></u>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(3&nbsp;&times; 7)</span></u>&nbsp;= 27</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6 + 21</span></u>&nbsp;= 27</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 27 = 27 (LHS = RHS)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Similarly,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-68.png\" style=\"width: 127px; height: 22px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(3&nbsp;&times; 2)</span></u>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(5&nbsp;&times; 6)</span></u>&nbsp;= ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6 + 30</span></u>&nbsp;= ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; <strong>36&nbsp;= ?</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, <strong>&quot;Option 4&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
    "solution_hi": "<p><strong>यहाँ अनुसरित तर्क निम्नानुसार है:</strong>&nbsp;यहाँ&nbsp;पंक्ति-वार पैटर्न का अनुसरण किया गया&nbsp;है।</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-66.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 127px; height: 22px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(1&nbsp;&times; 2)</span></u>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(4&nbsp;&times; 2)</span></u>&nbsp;= 10</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">2 + 8</span></u>&nbsp;= 10</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 10 = 10 (बायाँ पक्ष&nbsp;= दायाँ पक्ष)</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">और,</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-67.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 127px; height: 22px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(2&nbsp;&times; 3)</span></u>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(3&nbsp;&times; 7)</span></u>&nbsp;= 27</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6 + 21</span></u>&nbsp;= 27</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr; 27 = 27 (<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">बायाँ पक्ष</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;= दायाँ पक्ष</span>)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">इसी प्रकार,</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/07/25-7-2025%20IMG-518%20-68.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 127px; height: 22px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(3&nbsp;&times; 2)</span></u>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">(5&nbsp;&times; 6)</span></u>&nbsp;= ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">6 + 30</span></u>&nbsp;= ?</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">36&nbsp;= ?</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">इसलिए,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">सही उत्तर</span>&nbsp;<strong>&quot;विकल्प 4&quot;</strong>&nbsp;है।</p>\n",
