    "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Here is the logic used:</font></font></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Logic:&nbsp; </font></font><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Middle number = Sum of the products of opposite numbers</font></font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Picture 1:</font></font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/Task%20Id%201245%20Daman%20%282%29.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 148px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 22 = (5 x 2) + (3 x 4)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 22 = 10 + 12.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Picture 2:</font></font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/25/04/Task%20Id%201245%20Daman%20%283%29.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 148px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 49 = (3 x 8) + (5 x 5)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&rarr; 49 = 24 + 25.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Similarly,</font></font></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Figure 3 </font></font></span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: 